{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the only rancher in the city.\u00a0Manage your ranch with your friends! Care for animals, collect fresh resources like milk, eggs, meat, honey and wool. Every animal is different, with its own stats and possible mutations. Cook, produce, package and deliver tasty orders. Design and organize your ranch just the way you like, expand step by step, and watch your cozy little farm grow bigger every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/361c1a78e7e16f4a3e8efcd90adaf081.webp?t=1760044013\" width=258 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed, grow, and look after a variety of farm animals. Keep them healthy and happy to produce valuable resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/d91acd8a3bf9e7b8e4169205046107e0.poster.avif?t=1760044013\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/d91acd8a3bf9e7b8e4169205046107e0.webm?t=1760044013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/d91acd8a3bf9e7b8e4169205046107e0.mp4?t=1760044013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/edbe676f734aa5cba95c4d30ae29e488.webp?t=1760044013\" width=258 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Either buy food from local farmers in the city, or grow your own fruits and vegetables for a more cost-effective option. Manage your crops, collect harvests, and keep your animals happy and fed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/a525718bf68d0269db658afef3c5c150.poster.avif?t=1760044013\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/a525718bf68d0269db658afef3c5c150.webm?t=1760044013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/a525718bf68d0269db658afef3c5c150.mp4?t=1760044013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/1a8eacc3edb072c59d3972408a7132a6.webp?t=1760044013\" width=258 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect various animal originated resources from your animals like milk, wool, meat, eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/48c1391ff8715fa878a802f8adce8a38.poster.avif?t=1760044013\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/48c1391ff8715fa878a802f8adce8a38.webm?t=1760044013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/48c1391ff8715fa878a802f8adce8a38.mp4?t=1760044013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/2be389c4861a4ee1b1cfdce8d04ffd9a.webp?t=1760044013\" width=258 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook animal products, create more valuable items with recipes, package and organize your orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/ddc53f31f378d33aeb3b4ac80536b532.poster.avif?t=1760044013\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/ddc53f31f378d33aeb3b4ac80536b532.webm?t=1760044013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/ddc53f31f378d33aeb3b4ac80536b532.mp4?t=1760044013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/e9dae95a5470a59c54c88ad3f47d2c74.webp?t=1760044013\" width=258 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver your orders to earn more money, and grow your ranch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/5c09b464ff7c0346f969f9e25e1a6be7.poster.avif?t=1760044013\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/5c09b464ff7c0346f969f9e25e1a6be7.webm?t=1760044013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/5c09b464ff7c0346f969f9e25e1a6be7.mp4?t=1760044013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\